<title>MALTA: PRESS DIGEST - Malta - April 10.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Malta - April 10.</headline>
<dateline>VALLETTA 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are the leading stories in the Maltese press on Thursday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>THE TIMES</p>
<p>- Man dies in fireworks factory explosion. The explosion took place in an illegal fireworks factory in a farm at Lija in the centre of Malta on Wednesday.</p>
<p>- Constituted bodies agree to join government in technical talks on new taxation system to replace VAT.</p>
<p>L-ORIZZONT</p>
<p>- Fireworks factory explosion.</p>
<p>IN-NAZZJON</p>
<p>- Opposition leader to meet constituted bodies over proposed new tax system.</p>
</text>
